---
// Generated component for excavation-calculator
---
<div class="civil-workspace-container" data-civil-tool="excavation">
  <form id="calculator" novalidate class="civil-workspace"><div class="civil-input-column"><section class="input-card"><h2 class="sr-only">Excavation Dimensions & Soil</h2><div class="mode-bar" aria-label="Calculation workflow"><button type="button" data-mode="Rectangular" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mode-symbol" aria-hidden="true">▰</span>Rectangular</button><button type="button" data-mode="Trench" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mode-symbol" aria-hidden="true">▤</span>Trench</button><button type="button" data-mode="Sloped" aria-pressed="true"><span class="mode-symbol" aria-hidden="true">▥</span>Sloped</button><button type="button" data-mode="Circular" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mode-symbol" aria-hidden="true">▱</span>Circular</button><button type="button" data-mode="Custom" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mode-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◇</span>Custom</button></div><div class="unit-row"><span class="mode-context"></span><label>Dimension unit <select id="unit"><option>m</option><option>ft</option></select></label></div><div class="dimensions"></div><div class="conditional-rows"></div><section class="field-group"><h3>Soil, bulking &amp; truck basis</h3><div class="fields"><label class="field" for="soil"><span>Soil factor profile</span><select id="soil"><option>Custom · verify on site</option><option>Loose granular · editable example</option><option>Cohesive soil · editable example</option></select></label><label class="field" for="swell"><span>Bank → loose swell</span><span class="control"><input id="swell" type="number" value="25" min="0" max="200" step="any" required data-role="" inputmode="decimal"><span class="suffix">%</span></span></label><label class="field" for="truck"><span>Truck body</span><span class="control"><input id="truck" type="number" value="10" min="0.1" max="1000000" step="any" required data-role="" inputmode="decimal"><span class="suffix">m³</span></span></label><label class="field" for="payload"><span>Truck payload</span><span class="control"><input id="payload" type="number" value="14" min="0.1" max="1000000" step="any" required data-role="" inputmode="decimal"><span class="suffix">t</span></span></label><label class="field" for="retained"><span>Retained spoil · bank</span><span class="control"><input id="retained" type="number" value="10" min="0" max="1000000" step="any" required data-role="" inputmode="decimal"><span class="suffix">m³</span></span></label><label class="field" for="compaction"><span>Bank → compacted factor</span><span class="control"><input id="compaction" type="number" value="0.9" min="0.1" max="2" step="any" required data-role="" inputmode="decimal"><span class="suffix">×</span></span></label><label class="field" for="backfill"><span>Required compacted fill</span><span class="control"><input id="backfill" type="number" value="12" min="0" max="1000000" step="any" required data-role="" inputmode="decimal"><span class="suffix">m³</span></span></label><label class="field" for="looseDensity"><span>Loose density</span><span class="control"><input id="looseDensity" type="number" value="1.6" min="0.01" max="1000000" step="any" required data-role="" inputmode="decimal"><span class="suffix">t/m³</span></span></label></div></section><div class="validation" role="alert" hidden></div><div class="calculate-row"><button type="submit" class="calculate"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M8 6h8M8 11h2m3 0h2M8 15h2m3 0h2M8 19h2m3 0h2"/></svg>Calculate</button><button type="button" class="reset">Reset</button></div></section>
<div class="advanced-list"><details class="pricing"><summary><span class="price-heading" role="heading" aria-level="2">Cost Estimate <small>Optional · edit rates</small></span><strong class="pricing-total" aria-live="polite"></strong><span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="pricing-body"><div class="pricing-settings"><label class="price-enable"><input id="pricingEnabled" type="checkbox" checked>Include pricing</label><label class="currency-label">Currency<select id="currency"><option value="INR">INR (₹)</option><option value="USD">USD ($)</option><option value="EUR">EUR (€)</option><option value="GBP">GBP (£)</option></select></label></div><p class="pricing-note">Your entered rates only. Zero rates add no cost. Currency changes the label; amounts are not converted. No live prices or FX.</p><div class="pricing-fields"><label class="field" for="digRate"><span>Excavation / bank m³</span><span class="control"><input id="digRate" type="number" value="250" min="0" max="1000000" step="any" required data-role="" data-price="true" inputmode="decimal"><span class="suffix"></span></span></label><label class="field" for="loadRate"><span>Haul / truckload</span><span class="control"><input id="loadRate" type="number" value="1800" min="0" max="1000000" step="any" required data-role="" data-price="true" inputmode="decimal"><span class="suffix"></span></span></label><label class="field" for="otherCharges"><span>Other charges · flat</span><span class="control"><input id="otherCharges" type="number" value="0" min="0" max="1000000" step="any" required data-role="" data-price="true" inputmode="decimal"><span class="suffix"></span></span></label></div><div class="pricing-breakdown"></div><p class="pricing-rounding">Line amounts round to 2 decimal places; the total sums those lines. Cost uses calculated quantities before display rounding.</p><button type="button" class="recalculate-pricing">Recalculate estimate</button></div></details><details class="advanced"><summary><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 4 1-3h4l1 3 3 2 3 1v4l-3 2-1 3v3l-4 2-2-3-3-1H5l-2-4 3-2 1-3V7l2-3Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="11" r="3"/></svg>Soil factors &amp; planning notes<span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="advanced-body"><section class="field-group"><h3>Soil factors &amp; planning notes</h3><div class="fields"></div><p class="hint">Soil names are editable estimation examples, not a geotechnical classification or a safe-slope recommendation.</p></section></div></details><details class="advanced"><summary><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 4 1-3h4l1 3 3 2 3 1v4l-3 2-1 3v3l-4 2-2-3-3-1H5l-2-4 3-2 1-3V7l2-3Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="11" r="3"/></svg>Multiple sections &amp; measurement notes<span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="advanced-body"><section class="field-group"><h3>Multiple sections &amp; measurement notes</h3><div class="fields"></div><p class="hint">Add separate non-overlapping measured sections below. Custom areas use the prismoidal method; do not approximate a safety design from the illustration.</p></section><section class="row-section" data-rows="sections"><div class="section-head"><h3>Additional vertical sections</h3><span class="row-count"></span></div><div class="row-scroll"><div class="row-head"><span>Section</span><span>Length</span><span>Width</span><span>Depth</span><span>Qty</span><span></span></div><div class="rows"></div></div><button type="button" class="add-row small" data-add="sections">＋ Add section</button></section></div></details></div></div><div class="civil-result-column"><section class="visual-card"><div class="section-head"><h2>Excavation section · material states</h2><span class="illustrative">Illustrative material view</span></div><div class="artwork"><img src="/samples/excavation_pit_3d.png" alt="Realistic excavation material illustration; geometry is illustrative"><div class="dimension-badges"></div></div><div class="visual-extra"></div><div class="basis-banner"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 10v7m0-11v1"/></svg><span class="visual-caption"></span></div></section><section class="results" aria-label="Calculation results" data-stale="false"><div class="section-head"><h2><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 7 9-4 9 4v10l-9 4-9-4V7Zm0 0 9 4 9-4M12 11v10"/></svg>Results Summary</h2><span class="status" role="status">Calculated</span></div><div class="kpis"></div><h3 class="calculation-details-heading">Calculation Details</h3><div class="result-lower"><div class="result-detail"></div><div class="result-cost"></div></div></section>
<div class="output"><button type="button" class="print"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 8V3h12v5M6 16H3V8h18v8h-3M6 13h12v8H6z"/></svg>Print / Save PDF</button><button type="button" class="copy"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M16 8V3H3v14h5"/></svg>Copy Summary</button><p class="copy-status" role="status"></p></div></div></form>
  <details class="warning"><summary><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 10v7m0-11v1"/></svg>Important Notes / Warnings <span aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></summary><p>Volume and haul planning only—not excavation safety, slope approval, shoring or protective-system advice. Artwork is illustrative. This is an independent reference prototype, not a production engine or certified engineering design.</p></details>
</div>
<script is:inline src="/civil/config-excavation.js"></script>
<script is:inline src="/civil/pricing.js"></script>
<script is:inline src="/civil/reference.js"></script>
